16:{"id": "A00016", "round": 1, "step": 9, "summary": "text:找到了BDTI指数的EDB数据（代码S0031553）和OPEC产量数据。现在先读取这些文件获取具体数据，同时继续尝试其他数据查询。", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "找到了BDTI指数的EDB数据（代码S0031553）和OPEC产量数据。现在先读取这些文件获取具体数据，同时继续尝试其他数据查询。\n\n让我先检查一下落盘数据的内容，再继续搜索缺失的数据。"}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "call_00_d03DAV0CfRPLRtCCmGZp3271", "name": "bash", "input": {"command": "cd /Users/lufeng/Projects/fin-agent/runs/20260709-005304 && python3 -c \"\nimport json\n# 读取BDTI数据\nwith open('.agent/data/wind_001.json') as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\nprint('=== wind_001 (BDTI) keys ===')\nprint(list(data.keys()) if isinstance(data, dict) else type(data))\nif isinstance(data, dict):\n    for k,v in data.items():\n        if isinstance(v, list):\n            print(f'{k}: list len={len(v)}, first={v[0][:200] if v else None}')\n        elif isinstance(v, dict):\n            print(f'{k}: dict keys={list(v.keys())[:10]}')\n        else:\n            print(f'{k}: {str(v)[:200]}')\n\"\n"}}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "call_01_g5LZ2bbP6hVh1z2RZ0JZ8344", "name": "bash", "input": {"command": "cd /Users/lufeng/Projects/fin-agent/runs/20260709-005304 && python3 -c \"\nimport json\n# 读取OPEC产量数据\nwith open('.agent/data/wind_002.json') as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\nprint('=== wind_002 (OPEC) keys ===')\nprint(list(data.keys()) if isinstance(data, dict) else type(data))\nif isinstance(data, dict):\n    for k,v in data.items():\n        if isinstance(v, list):\n            print(f'{k}: list len={len(v)}, first={str(v[0])[:200] if v else None}')\n        elif isinstance(v, dict):\n            print(f'{k}: dict keys={list(v.keys())[:10]}')\n        else:\n            print(f'{k}: {str(v)[:200]}')\n\"\n"}}]}
