22:{"id": "A00022", "round": 1, "step": 15, "summary": "text:数据很好！BDTI有2025年至今的每日数据，OPEC产量有月度数据。现在让我获取更详细的BDTI近期数据，并提取BDTI价格走势，同时尝试获取更多补充数据。 | tool_use:bash | tool_use:bash", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "数据很好！BDTI有2025年至今的每日数据，OPEC产量有月度数据。现在让我获取更详细的BDTI近期数据，并提取BDTI价格走势，同时尝试获取更多补充数据。"}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "call_00_XfV2veqchzVbyLNMjhUV5818", "name": "bash", "input": {"command": "cd /Users/lufeng/Projects/fin-agent/runs/20260709-005304 && python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('.agent/data/wind_001.json') as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\nbdti = data['data']['data'][0]\ndates = bdti['date']\nvals = bdti['value']\nprint('=== BDTI 原油运输指数 2025-2026 数据 ===')\n# 每月取一个样本展示\nseen_months = set()\nfor d,v in zip(dates, vals):\n    m = d[:6]\n    if m not in seen_months:\n        seen_months.add(m)\n        print(f'{d}: {v}')\nprint(f'\\\\n总数据点: {len(dates)}')\nprint(f'最新日期: {dates[-1]}, 最新值: {vals[-1]}')\n# 一些关键统计\nimport statistics\nprint(f'\\\\n2025年至今:')\nprint(f'  均值: {statistics.mean(vals):.1f}')\nprint(f'  最大值: {max(vals):.1f}')\nprint(f'  最小值: {min(vals):.1f}')\n# 分段统计\ny2025_vals = [v for d,v in zip(dates,vals) if d.startswith('2025')]\ny2026_vals = [v for d,v in zip(dates,vals) if d.startswith('2026')]\nif y2025_vals:\n    print(f'  2025年均值: {statistics.mean(y2025_vals):.1f}, 范围: {min(y2025_vals):.1f}-{max(y2025_vals):.1f}')\nif y2026_vals:\n    print(f'  2026年均值: {statistics.mean(y2026_vals):.1f}, 范围: {min(y2026_vals):.1f}-{max(y2026_vals):.1f}')\n# 近30日均值\nif len(vals)>=30:\n    print(f'  近30日均值: {statistics.mean(vals[-30:]):.1f}')\n\"\n"}}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "call_01_PMEElsDqyq9ooZANrN5i7087", "name": "bash", "input": {"command": "cd /Users/lufeng/Projects/fin-agent/runs/20260709-005304 && python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('.agent/data/wind_002.json') as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\n# 使用月度OPEC产量\nfor series in data['data']['data']:\n    meta = series['meta']\n    if meta['code'] == 'S5105044':  # 月频数据\n        dates = series['date']\n        vals = series['value']\n        print('=== OPEC原油产量(月度,千桶/天) ===')\n        seen = set()\n        for d,v in zip(dates, vals):\n            y = d[:4]\n            if y not in seen:\n                seen.add(y)\n                print(f'{d}: {v}')\n        print(f'\\\\n总数据点: {len(dates)}')\n        print(f'最新: {dates[-1]}: {vals[-1]} 千桶/天')\n        # 最近趋势\n        print(f'最近6个月:')\n        for d,v in zip(dates[-6:], vals[-6:]):\n            print(f'  {d}: {v} 千桶/天')\n\"\n"}}]}
