{"id": "A00028", "round": 1, "step": 21, "summary": "text:步数将尽，我来整理已有数据并写入交付物。同时也提取一下BDTI月度均值便于分析周期位置，以及布伦特原油的年度趋势。 | tool_use:bash", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "步数将尽，我来整理已有数据并写入交付物。同时也提取一下BDTI月度均值便于分析周期位置，以及布伦特原油的年度趋势。"}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "call_00_cYQscBS5ZmEoXpeEIOM16703", "name": "bash", "input": {"command": "cd /Users/lufeng/Projects/fin-agent/runs/20260709-005304 && python3 -c \"\nimport json\n# BDTI 月度均值统计\nwith open('.agent/data/wind_001.json') as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\nbdti = data['data']['data'][0]\ndates = bdti['date']\nvals = bdti['value']\n\n# 按年月分组\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nmonthly = defaultdict(list)\nfor d,v in zip(dates, vals):\n    monthly[d[:6]].append(v)\n\nprint('=== BDTI 月度均值 ===')\nfor ym in sorted(monthly.keys()):\n    avg = sum(monthly[ym])/len(monthly[ym])\n    print(f'{ym}: {avg:.1f} (n={len(monthly[ym])})')\n\n# 布伦特原油月度均值\nwith open('.agent/data/wind_004.json') as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\nfor series in data['data']['data']:\n    meta = series['meta']\n    if '布伦特' in meta['name'] and '连续' in meta['name']:\n        dates = series['date']\n        vals = series['value']\n        monthly_oil = defaultdict(list)\n        for d,v in zip(dates, vals):\n            monthly_oil[d[:6]].append(v)\n        print('\\\\n=== 布伦特原油月度均值 ===')\n        for ym in sorted(monthly_oil.keys()):\n            avg = sum(monthly_oil[ym])/len(monthly_oil[ym])\n            print(f'{ym}: {avg:.1f} 美元/桶 (n={len(monthly_oil[ym])})')\n        break\n\"\n"}}]}
