[01:07:19] MODEL   好，数据格式是 `data.data[0].date` 和 `data.data[0].value`。让我提取WTI和布伦特的年度均值：
[01:07:19] TOOL    bash {"command": "cd /Users/lufeng/Projects/fin-agent/runs/20260709-005304 && python3 -c \"\nimport json\n\ndef load_wind_data(filepath):\n    with open(filepath) as f:\n        raw = json.load(f)\n    d0 = raw['data']['data'][0]\n    dates = d0['date']\n    values = d0['value']\n    return dates, [float(v) if v != '' else None for v in values]\n\n# WTI\nwti_dates, wti_values = load_wind_data('.agent/data/wind_016.json')\nbrent_dates, brent_values = load_wind_data('.agent/data/wind_017.json')\n\n# 按年份/月份统计\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nimport statistics\n\ndef monthly_avg(dates, values):\n    m_data = defaultdict(list)\n    for dt, v in zip(dates, values):\n        if v is None: continue\n        month_key = dt[:6]  # YYYYMM\n        m_data[month_key].append(v)\n    result = {}\n    for mk in sorted(m_data):\n        vals = m_data[mk]\n        result[mk] = round(statistics.mean(vals), 1)\n    return result\n\nprint('=== WTI原油月度均值（美元/桶）===')\nwti_monthly = monthly_avg(wti_dates, wti_values)\nfor mk, v in wti_monthly.items():\n    print(f'{mk}: {v}')\n\nprint()\nprint('=== 布伦特原油月度均值（美元/桶）===')\nbrent_monthly = monthly_avg(brent_dates, brent_values)\nfor mk, v in brent_monthly.items():\n    print(f'{mk}: {v}')\n\n# 年度均值\nprint()\nprint('=== 年度均值 ===')\nfor label, monthly in [('WTI', wti_monthly), ('布伦特', brent_monthly)]:\n    yearly = defaultdict(list)\n    for mk, v in monthly.items():\n        yearly[mk[:4]].append(v)\n    for yk in sorted(yearly):\n        vals = yearly[yk]\n        avg = round(statistics.mean(vals), 1)\n        low = min(vals)\n        high = max(vals)\n        print(f'{label} {yk}: 均值={avg}, 范围=[{low}, {high}]')\n\"\n"}
